How can you implement a Bubble Sort algorithm in Java?

### Response:
public class BubbleSort {

 public static void sort(int[] arr) {
  int n = arr.length;
  int temp;

  for(int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {
   for (int j = 0; j < n - i - 1; j++) {
    if (arr[j] > arr[j+1]) {
     // Swap the elements
     temp = arr[j];
     arr[j] = arr[j+1];
     arr[j+1] = temp;
    }
   }
  }
 }
}

